window.products.push({"id":474040,"name":"Y.S.T TRAVELERS Tumbler Insulated Stainless Steel Travel Mug with Lid, Straw, and Brush That Keeps Drinks Hot or Cold Longer, Blue, 30 oz.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919Kv08-ehL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEST LARGE-SIZE TRAVEL MUG: With the Y.S.T. TRAVELERS 30 OUNCE TUMBLER, you can hold up to 30 ounces of hot or cold liquids for longer than most containers on the market today; it measures approximately 8 inches tall and almost 4 inches wide including its lid; weighing a little over 13 ounces and having an embedded logo at the bottom; there are 3 color options of sky blue, red, or silver; also included free is a bent sipping straw plus a long thin cleaning brush in a gift box; KEEP DRINKS COLD OR HOT A LONG TIME: The well-designed and high-quality Y.S.T. TRAVELERS 30 OUNCE TUMBLER easily keeps ice solid for up to 24 hours or a hot drink warm for 6 hours; with the ability to hold up to 30 ounces of liquid, no need for extra warmers, coolers, or ice packs as this cup will keep the drink cold or warm for a long time when outside in the elements or indoors; with the lid securely in place and the straw inserted, little heat or cold escapes; 18/8 STAINLESS STEEL CONSTRUCTION: With its double food grade 18/8 stainless steel wall, vacuum insulation, durable construction, and a shatterproof ABS plastic lid with a rubberized seal, the Y.S.T. TRAVELERS 30 OUNCE TUMBLER is high quality, strong, resistant, and easy to clean; all materials are BPA and lead-free; the sipping straw and cleaning brush are also stainless steel so will not rust; the metal straw is ergonomically bent and can be used when the cover is on the mug; NO SWEAT, NO EXTERIOR TEMPERATURE CHANGE: The Y.S.T. TRAVELERS 30 OUNCE TUMBLER’s exterior will not sweat, allowing for dry hands while using; when filled with cold or hot liquids, no abrupt temperature change is felt on its outside; all parts are dishwasher safe and will not rust or crack; the cup measures 7.75 inches tall, 3.9 inches wide at the top, and 3 inches at the bottom so fits most cupholders while the lid is 0.87 inches thick and 4.12 inches in diameter; 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE: If you are not completely satisfied with our travel mug, contact us for a replacement or full refund; BUY WITH CONFIDENCE as we want you to be happy with your RISK-FREE purchase of the Y.S.T. TRAVELERS 30 OUNCE TUMBLER that comes with a FREE stainless steel bent SIPPING STRAW and CLEANING BRUSH in a beautifully designed package ready for giving. Perfect for the traveler or those who camp, hike, go to the gym, or drink lots of fluids.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919Kv08-ehL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Y.S.T TRAVELERS","source_asin":"B01M984765","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M984765","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M984765","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
