window.products.push({"id":474137,"name":"Calicot Apron 100% Cotton with an Adjustable Neck with Long Ties for Kitchen Women Men Chef Home (27.5 Inch by 31.5 Inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sBG7-vY2L._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton Imported Drawstring closure machine wash PACKAGE INCLUDES: 1 Apron with the long waist ties and an adjustable neck strap and has a large outer front pocket. Made from 100% cotton, apron is preshrunk to avoid fabric shrinkage after wash and making it suitable for everyday use. Our products are manufactured in India. SIZE: Generous fit, works for men and women with the long waist ties and a adjustable neck strap. Each apron width is 27.50\" and the length is 31.50\" MULTIPLE USES: Apart from cooking, the apron gives great protection while using dishwasher, washing your dogs or trimming the yard. It is comfortable to wear and has an adjustable neck strap, so you can choose the perfect height for you. Once you are done, rinse or use a soapy cloth to get the grime off. MATERIAL: Our cooking aprons are made of 100% pure cotton which is soft to touch, stylish to look, lightweight and comfortable to wear. EASY CARE & MAINTENANCE: Machine wash warm with like colors, do not bleach, tumble dry low and warm iron if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sBG7-vY2L._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CALICOT","source_asin":"B0C461GLZT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C461GLZT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C461GLZT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":474138,"name":"HZ&HY Oversized King Bedspread Aqua, Ultrasonic Coverlet Bedding Set, Lightweight Thin Comforter, Reversible, 5 Piece, 100% Microfiber, King/Cal King,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EWnvKFsoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OVERSIZED SIZE - Perfect for a larger and taller king size bed, thick mattresses, split adjustable bed. The oversized bedspread almost comes all the way down to the floor, beautiful scalloped edge that lends it a graceful drape, even no need for dust ruffle bedskirt. you'll love it in the bedroom. DURABLE - Perfect for families with pets or children. Using Ultrasonic Quilting Technology, the stitching is seamless so can't ravel apart ever. PERFECT SEASON DECORATION - Gorgeous & Elegant Damask Pattern with beautiful scallop edge brings luxurious and classy look to your bedroom decor, Reversible with the same pattern and color on both sides. It is a good choice to decorate and enhance the master or guest room with this stylish bedspread set. LIGHTWEIGHT & SOFT - Obtained OEKO-TEX Standard 100 certification. 100% Microfiber Polyester, Excellent Quality Material, the texture is slightly brushed, soft and light which perfect for all season. In summer or warmer weather, you can layer it with a blanket/sheet underneath. In the winter, you can add a comforter underneath. HASSLE-FREE CLEANING: Easy to clean (NO Dog's hairs left), machine wash cold and dry quickly. Resistant fade, shrink, pilling and wrinkle. More durable than cotton (you may follow the care instructions).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EWnvKFsoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HZ & HY","source_asin":"B0B6NHRT5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6NHRT5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6NHRT5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":474139,"name":"Hiware 10-Pair Reusable Fiberglass Chopsticks, Non-Slip Chop Sticks Set Japanese Style, Dishwasher Safe, 9.5-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714JWQDfTtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Chopsticks Set: Pack of 10 pairs in 5 soft colors - purplish blue, pale purple, powder pink, ivory and peagreen. Super good quality, functional design and aesthetic look with nice weight for skilled user and new learner. Healthy Material: They are made of high-quality fiberglass that different from wooden or bamboo made which is tend to warp, crack and stain remained, these material keeps these chopsticks super durable, non-break, non-dents, non-scrapes, non-cracks, and non-bend, and as while, they also heat-resistant and stay safe in fried food. No BPA, no lead, no any other harmful substances and totally food safe. Square & Non-slip Designs For Easy Using: The chopsticks are shaped square that makes them easier for hand gripping without slippery than round ones, and anti-slip lines on the chopstick’s body boost the holding even for beginning users. The pointed end is frosted textured to provide a nice catch of some slippery food over smooth surface. Dishwasher Safe & Easy To Clean: The chopsticks clean easily and can be safely put in the dishwasher for no coating outside. They are not typically etched in circumference circles like others that are harder to clean up as sometimes residues left inside, we designed surfaced textures for better clean up. Great Functional With Many Foods: These chopsticks are perfect for eating typical Asian food and a must-have if you want to try a different eating way, such as sushi, ramen, noodles, hot pot, sweet and sour chicken, kung pao chicken and dumplings, or even some middle eastern food. Also excellent for stir-fry nights and other special occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714JWQDfTtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIWARE","source_asin":"B0BF8NMBG9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF8NMBG9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF8NMBG9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
