window.products.push({"id":474181,"name":"Madhu International Tassel Curtains - Fringe Curtains - Mandala Curtains - Tapestry Curtains - Boho Curtain for Windows, Living Room, Bedroom - Dorm R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TRhLq0C1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Material: Perfect Drapes For Summer And Winter. Handcrafted With Pure Cotton Fabric, These Living Room Bohemian Mandala Curtains Are Superior To Other Tapestry Curtains In The Market And Are So Soft, Stretchy, Thick And Durable. Designed To Reduce Some Unwanted Light For Any Living Spaces, This Curtain Drape Set Prevents Both Excess Sun Rays And Wind From Entering The Room That Helps To Maintain The Temperature Of The Room At A Moderate Level. Ideal Accessory For All Seasons. Perfect Size: Create A Happy Mood With The Help Of These Cotton Handmade Curtains The Fringes In Our Long Tapestry Hippie Curtains Make Any Living Space More Elegant And Luxurious. This Decorative Mandala Curtain Set Contains 2 Panels Each Measuring 41 Inches Wide By 87 Inches Long Which Is Long Enough To Cover All Kinds Of Doors And Windows. Our Tapestry Hippie Curtains With Tassels Come With Built-in Road Pockets Which Are Designed To Fit For Curtain Rods Up To 2.5 Inches In Diameter. Attractive Design: Add A Sense Of Ethnic Feel To All Living Spaces! Infused With Indian Traditional Style, These Tassel Curtains Are Made With Care By Local Artisans Focusing Mainly On Each Detail Of The Curtain Design. The Advanced Hd Printing Technology, Floral Pattern, Clear Prints, Vivid Colours Of This Bohemian Tapestry Curtain Gives A Second Life To Any Of Your Dull Or Perished Rooms. This Bohemian Fringes Cotton Curtain Is Going To Be Your Favourite Home Decor Stuff For All Seasons. Ambience Decoration: Welcome Your Guest And Make Them Astonished With Our Tasselled Curtains. These Timeless Classic Hanging Drapes Decorate Your Home With Fresh Effect And Give A Happy Mood. The Simple Design Pattern Of Our Front Door Decor Hippie Bohemian Curtains Has A Creative Look That Tricks Out A Graceful And Chic Appearance To Any Space. It Surely Brightens Up Your Home Decorations And Creates A Festive Mood. These Mandala Cotton Curtains With Lace Perfectly Match Any Home Styles. Care Instructions: You Never Have To Worry About Taking Strenuous Steps To Keep The Drapes Curtains Set Clean At All Times. They Require Very Little Maintenance And Are Easier To Keep When Compared To Other Traditional Mandala Cotton Curtains That Are Available In The Market. For Long Lasting Usage, Wash In Cold Water And Spot Clean In Case Of Stains. Do Not Bleach In Any Case As The Curtains Are Made With Specially Treated Dye So That The Colors Do Not Fade With Time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TRhLq0C1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madhu International","source_asin":"B0BF4N19QL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF4N19QL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF4N19QL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
