window.products.push({"id":474235,"name":"iDesign 27160 Forma Metal Free Standing Toilet Paper Tissue Holder, Roll Reserve Canister for Kids', Guest, Master, Office Bathroom, 7\" x 7\" x 14.5\", ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cU9AmQmBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The iDesign Forma Toilet Paper Holder is the stylish and practical bathroom accessory you have been searching for. This holder allows you to store three additional rolls all within arm's reach for your convenience. The free standing design is compact and easy to fit in any space, whether it be in the corner of the room or between a sink and toilet. The brushed silver finish is stylish and will fit in with any decor. Constructed of durable stainless steel, this stand features raised feet to keep the rolls off the floor. Measuring 7\" x 14.5\", the iDesign Forma Toilet Paper Holder will provide the organization you dream of in your bathroom. With iDesign by InterDesign, you can #LiveSimply every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cU9AmQmBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iDesign","source_asin":"B093JFV5GZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093JFV5GZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093JFV5GZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":474236,"name":"Marvel Avengers Door Stopper - Official Marvel Product - Avengers Block Fully Functional Home Accent Weighted Cuddly and Soft Pillow Like Plush Door S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f6FmlBYvL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"MARVEL AVENGERS DOOR STOPPER: Avengers, Assemble! Immerse yourself into the MARVEL Multiverse with The MARVEL Characters Hexagon Door Stopper. Your room will reach a new realm with this decorative and functional door stopper showcasing vibrant and colorful portraits of your favorite characters in their power poses poking through hexagon shapes. Featuring your favorite heroes like Iron Man, Captain America, Thor, Hulk, Black Widow, Hawkeye, Vision, Antman, Daredevil and Black Panther! POWERFUL DECOR ADDITION: Decorate your home, office, bedroom and any other space with your favorite heroes. Each character has a double sided design to ensure they fit in anywhere. As a cute door stopper or bookend, these Marvel legends will blend in with your blankets and bedding in anyone’s room! HIGH QUALITY MULTI-FUNCTIONAL HOME ACCENT: Crafted of durable polyester to ensure easy care, this door stopper is weighted with sand in a protective liner to ensure the your character stays in place whether they're holding your door open or accessorizing your shelf. Easily movable with a sturdy handle attached to a metal grommet ring, our door stoppers are great for kids and adults of all ages. Use it as a balloon weight at your next Marvel themed party! SIZE AND CARE: Each door stopper weighs a strong 2.5 pounds to hold your doors, books and more. Spot clean only. Use it as an addition to your Halloween decorations to match your costume! COMPLETE THE COLLECTION: Look out for our heroes on other styles and items like draft guards. This item includes MARVEL official licensee packaging. Find your favorite hero and bring them home today! If you have any issues, please reach out to customer service for assistance! AMAZING QUALITY YOU CAN ACTUALLY TRUST: When it comes to your home and family’s safety, there’s no room for cutting corners. Every single one of our premium quality, weighted door stoppers is made of nothing but the finest, safest materials and they are heavy enough to prevent any door from slamming shut. Perfect for your kid’s bedroom, living room, corridors or any other door that may get in your way! Other door stopper may lock up under but these are movable! THE PERFECT GIFT FOR YOUR FRIENDS & FAMILY: Are you looking for a heartwarming, beautiful gift for one of your Marvel-loving friends or family? Well, look no further! These wonderful decorative door stoppers are not only a highly useful everyday household item, they will also put a smile on the face of your friends and loved ones each time they take a look at them. Idea for birthdays, house-warming gifts or any other occasion! Especially if you want to use them as balloon anchors too!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f6FmlBYvL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Morgan Home","source_asin":"B09ZWP1DNW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZWP1DNW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZWP1DNW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
