window.products.push({"id":474260,"name":"Fashionlite Christmas Tree Topper with 48FT 128LED Fairy String Lights, Clear Star Tree Topper with Warm White String Light, USB Plug, 8 Modes, Timer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g2Z1dEtAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"More colors and styles Christmas tree top with USB fairy string lights are available in our store!!!! 1.Xmas tree topper optional style: We sell not only gold tree topper but also transparent tree topper. 2.Light color options: Not only multi colored, you can browse our store to choose RGB or warm white.  2021 Upgraded Christmas Star Tree Topper with RGB String Lights for Christmas Decorations Indoor!!! ·Our star for Christmas tree top is made of durable PVC with golden trim. Reusable quality and make your tree bling. ·Upgraded hanging way of fairy string lights. Just straighten out the branches. Avoid messy winding and knotting of traditional winding string lights. ·Christmas green PVC layer on string lights has better invisibility and harmony. When hanging on a Christmas tree, it's like the whole tree is glowing by itself. ·8 switching setting including Combination, In Waves, Sequential, Slo-glo, Chasing/Flash, Slow Fade, Twinkle/Flash, Steady. ·Open timer modes of 6h on and 18h off to save energy. ·Brightness adjustment for enjoy the glamour of light. ·Multifunctional USB plug also allow you to switch 8 flashing modes. Very convenient even if your remote control is not in hands. Specification: 1.Optional size: 48FT: 8 stands, each is 6 ft with 16 leds, 48 feet & 128 led in total. 80FT: 10 stands, each is 8 ft with 20 leds, 80 feet & 200 led in total. 2.Length of USB power cable: 9.8FT (3m) 3.Output: 5V safe low voltage Kindly Note: 1.IP20 waterproof grade. Do not use it on rainy days or snowy day!!! 2.Try not to use it outdoors!!!!! If you must use it outdoors, be sure it in sunny weather!!! 3.USB plug is not waterproof. Do not immerse the USB plug in water!!! 4.Please unplug the USB plug from the power supply if you are not using it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g2Z1dEtAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashionlite","source_asin":"B09B7NVHKV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B7NVHKV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B7NVHKV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
