window.products.push({"id":474278,"name":"JOSE ARTESANO Pine Needle (Ocoxal) Waste Basket, 9.8 in x 9.8 in, Cylindrical, Wicker Trash Can, Natural, 100% Sustainable, Organic and Vegan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OMOkLkXsL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"OUR BRAND JOSE ARTESANO has always been inspired by organic handcrafted products creatively made by the artistic hands of Mexican artisans. JOSE ARTESANO’s main objective is to portray the richness of the natural resources and the culture hidden behind our beautiful Mexico. We produce amazing creations using raw and sustainable materials provided by mother nature. These products are made out of OCOXAL, an ancestral method to create handicrafts that reflect the latent and close contact that Mexican rural communities have with their natural surroundings, the Pine Forest. When the Pine Needles reach the extraordinary and expert working hands of Mexican artisans, it reveals the unlimited imagination which results in pieces of handicrafts with colorful threads with a natural Pine Forest aroma. Click on our brand name to discover more incredible products from us. Product Description: ✔ Waste Basket Dimensions: 9.8 IN (Length) x 9.8 IN (Width) x 9.8 IN (Height) ✔ Product Weight: 2.2 Pounds. ✔ Product Materials: Pine Needles (Ocoxal). ✔ Product Finish: Woven Raw Pine Needle. ✔ Brand / Manufacturer: JOSE ARTESANO.✔ Country of Origin: Mexico.✔ Quantity of Items: 1 Natural Pine Needle Waste Basket. ✔ Product Shape: Cylindrical.✔ Product Specifications: Pine Needle products cannot be washed, pressed, and should not be placed in damp places. If it is wet, place it in a well-ventilated area to dry it. The product has a natural Pine Forest scent. 100% Sustainable and biodegradable. ✔ Product Packaging: Raw Cotton Fabric Bag. ✔ Disclaimers: As these are handcrafted products, each one is unique and they can be slightly different. Products may contain splinters. NON MICROWAVABLE.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OMOkLkXsL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOSE ARTESANO","source_asin":"B08VKQQ6TX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VKQQ6TX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VKQQ6TX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
