window.products.push({"id":474334,"name":"Wine & Whiskey Decanter Gift Set for Men & Women Whiskey Decanter, 2 Iceberg Whiskey Glasses, 2 Coasters, 8 Stainless Steel Whisky Rocks Chillers, Ton","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lfy5EWnuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy the ultimate whiskey experience with this Luxe Whiskey Set. The perfect gift for any whiskey lover, it includes all you need to drink in style, including a Luxury Whisky Decanter made of thick borosilicate, Mahogany Wooden Box, Coasters, Tongs, 8 Cubed Whiskey Stones that are 100% non-toxic & natural are handcrafted to keep your whiskey cool & can be used to chill wine and tea as well as a Freezer Pouch. Decant your favorite scotch, single malt or bourbon with this elegant whiskey decanter set. The exquisite shapes of each piece let you pour a dram with style and precision. Create a memorable experience for you, your family, or friends with the perfect decanter set. The set comes with everything you need to properly store and display whiskey, What better way to enjoy your favorite whiskey than with this elegant decanter set. Handmade and mouthblown of the highest quality by master artisans. Enjoy spirits with sophistication & class as you sip a way with this set of two glasses that are pieces to admire. Featuring a statuesque look, these glasses making drinking not only a unique experience, but a lively affair. The shimmering glasses and decanter boast deep vertical and horizontal cuts across the borosilicate for a three dimensional striking display that brings a textural quality to the surface. Resolutely modern, the classic shape with the delicate cubed attributes create a play on texture that produces a stunning effect. This elegant decanter set comes with everything needed to effortlessly pour glasses of whiskey. Sometimes, everybody needs to slow down and enjoy the finer things in life: family and friends, good conversation and a few laughs. This handy decanter set makes it easy to pour a terrific glass of whiskey—or other spirits— for yourself and your guests. No one will say no to a refill with this extraordinary set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lfy5EWnuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Wine Savant","source_asin":"B092JPVMWC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474334","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092JPVMWC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092JPVMWC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":474335,"name":"Gallery Solutions 12x12 White Float Frame For Floating Display of 10x10 Image","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hp-eS32AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gallery Solutions 12x12 White Float Frame For Floating Display of 8x8 Image Add a touch of style into any space with the Gallery Solutions 12x12 White Float Frame. It's on-trend gallery style design features a bold 1.5 inch frame profile in white and two glass panes to insert your photos or art between for a floating effect. Includes ready-to-hang durable hangers on the back. Making it easy for you to showcase your photos or art, beautifully. The square format makes it perfect for displaying your favorite Instagram, Instax or Pinterest photos! The double glass design allows you to get creative and create a collage or simply display a few of your special moments captured on your smartphone. Our Gallery Solutions 12x12 White Float Frame is ideal for floating images measuring 10 inches x 10 inches or smaller.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hp-eS32AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gallery Solutions","source_asin":"B00RT634QU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RT634QU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RT634QU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":474336,"name":"Kinks & Quirks Aye Aye Adam Lori Mitchell Collectible Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tv2fLzqEL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Product Specification Material: Hand painted resin Originality: Original Weight: 1.00 LBS ABOUT US: Almost everything we sell is handmade or designed in America. We are so proud to represent such amazing and talented artists…there have been over 1,400 through the years! Unique handcrafted works from over 400 artisans from throughout the United States are on display. Fall in love with these Figures: Fall in love with this darling piece! Designed by Lori, In Lori’s signature style, Figure is adorned in traditional folk art patterns and motifs while a blissfully happy expression graces its adorable face. The delightful duo poses atop an intricately hand painted figure that perfectly complements the scene of love. This lovely summer piece makes a sweet gift for your loved one on any day of the year. One of the featured artists for The Kinks & Quirks is Lori Mitchell . Lori Mitchell was born and raised in Marietta, Georgia. She is a graduate of the Rhode Island School of Design. Lori finds inspiration in old illustrations, children’s tales and anything whimsical. In 1998, she discovered folk art, and fell in love with the charm and nostalgia that this field embraces. Lori creates pieces that take people back to the magical years of childhood. In designing, Lori starts off with an idea, but as she sculpts, the characters begin to define their own personality. Lori is known for her exaggerated proportions and expressions…and every piece must have crazy socks! Lori creates pieces that take people back to the magical years of childhood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tv2fLzqEL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kinks & Quirks","source_asin":"B0886KZ49Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0886KZ49Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0886KZ49Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
