window.products.push({"id":474399,"name":"Amazon Brand – Pinzon 500-Thread-Count Pima Cotton Standard Pillowcases, Fog Grey, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DKPa1mjaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Elegant looks and a luxurious feel come together in these 100% Pima Cotton solid color pillow case pairs Available in a range of fashionable colors that include white, canvas, Flintstone blue, fog grey and mineral green. The pillow cases have a super silky hand and a lustrous shine. The fine-weave 100-percent Pima cotton makes these pillow cases soft. silky and elegant. Durable yet soft, the linens are perfect for adding a sumptuous feel to the bed without breaking the bank in the process. This package includes two pillowcases. For easy care, it washes up in the machine and tumbles dry. An Amazon Brand. Amazon.com Super-soft pillowcases made of 500-thread-count 100% Pima cotton. view larger Pima Cotton Pillowcases What You Need to Know: Set of 2 pillowcases Set of 2 pillowcases Made of 500-thread-count 100% Pima cotton Made of 500-thread-count 100% Pima cotton Super silky hand and lustrous shine Super silky hand and lustrous shine Available in Standard and King Available in Standard and King Variety of colors available Variety of colors available Coordinates with Pinzon 500TC sheet set Coordinates with Pinzon 500TC sheet set Machine washable Machine washable Assortment of inspiring earth-tone colors available. view larger Pinzon 500-Thread-Count Pima Cotton Pillowcases Seriously Soft Indulge in the sensation of seriously soft with this set of two pillowcases by Pinzon. The opulent set combines elegant simplicity with 500-thread-count fine-weave 100% Pima cotton for a durable yet extremely silky and soft-to-the-touch experience. Ideal for a master bedroom or notable guest room, the superior-quality pillowcases offer lustrous shine and make for a luxurious addition to any cozy bed. You deserve to feel pampered at the end of the day. Pinzon makes it possible. Variety of Sizes and Colors Available in Standard or King size, the pillowcases nicely complement Pinzon's 500-thread-count Pima cotton sheet set--perfect when wanting to add additional pillowcases to the set. The pillowcases can also be used with other bedding ensembles for an extra dose of extravagant comfort. The lovely pillowcases come in a range of earth-tone colors including White, Canvas, Flint Blue, Fog Grey, and Mineral Green. Each long-lasting color resists fading and will blend beautifully with existing solid or patterned comforters, decorative throw pillows, and surrounding bedroom decor. Machine Washable For easy cleaning, the 500-thread-count Pima cotton pillow-case set is machine-washable and can go in the dryer--or be hung out on the clothesline to dry on a warm sunny day. Pinzon Bedding A few simple upgrades in the bedroom can create the welcome effect of a new beginning--whether it's January 1st or a Sunday. Such a simple pleasure, really--fresh, clean sheets, fluffy pillows, and cozy comforters. You can feel like a five-star guest in your own home with bed linens by Pinzon. Fold back the covers, slip into sweet happy dreams, and wake up refreshed. It's a brand-new day. For the master bedroom or a charming guest room, the Pinzon brand provides the high-quality bedding needed for a restful night of sleep. The Pinzon brand includes everything from memory foam mattress pads, mattress and pillow protectors, sheets, and duvet sets to luxurious Permaloft pillows, which you can never have enough of--especially when enjoying breakfast in bed (sometimes you just have to indulge). About Pinzon Invite Amazon.com's Pinzon products into your home for their form and function, and experience their style, craftsmanship, and value. We travel the world to find the best materials and designs for Pinzon products and use the most sensible manufacturing methods. We thoroughly test each Pinzon item and rely on feedback from our customers to help us deliver the highest quality. Check out all of our Pinzon products, including bedding, towels, and more, and you'll find something for all occasions at the best values. With a selection that continues to grow, the Pinzon brand is set to become a part of your lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DKPa1mjaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinzon","source_asin":"B00CLCND9U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CLCND9U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CLCND9U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
