window.products.push({"id":474499,"name":"Air Purifier Filter - 3-in-1 True HEPA Air Purifier Filter, Perfect for Home & Office, Reduce Pet Dander, Household Odor, Smoke & Dust","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+5G4UnHpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Do you ever dreamed about you can get a taste of newly mowed lawn, flowers blooming in profusion from every breath?It would feel like you are running freely in wild grassland surrounded by splendid nature, far from the tail gas, carbon monoxide, and everything in the noisy city.Air Choice Air Purifier will make that happen, just for you. 3-in-1 Air Purifier True HEPA filter & pre-filter & Activated Carbon Filter. 3 stage filtration system remove 99.97% of dust, pollen, smoke, odor, and pet dander. Air purifier’s filters particles as small as 0.3 microns, and larger air pollution of PM 2.5.Air Choice air purifier covers up to an average to large living room of 322 sq.ft; CADR Rated 135+ CFM(233m³/h), refresh your air in just 10 mins. 3 Fan Speeds Low/Mid/High fan speeds efficiently provide clean & fresh air into every corners of the room in daily life. Auto Mode Smart Auto Mode will automatically detect the surrounding air quality, and adjust appropriate fan speed according to the quality of air in the room. Sleep Mode & Quiet Operation with Timer Sleep mode sets the purifier to its lowest setting to produce fresh air as you soundly slumber without disturbing noise; set the auto-off timer to safeguard your respiration system while you sleep. Air Quality Indicator Light Air quality indicator light has 3 colors to keep you informed of your air quality. Filter Replacement When the light for reset button is flashing, it reminds you that replace the filter. Please only use the replacement filters every 6 months to maintain performance. Filter can be easily replaced with just a few simple steps. Guarantee This air purifier for home is supported by a 1-year full warranty with 24/7 dedicated customer support. If you have any questions with your air purifier, please do not hesitate to contact us and we will address your concerns within 12 hrs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+5G4UnHpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TRUSTECH","source_asin":"B07Q49H6G9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q49H6G9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q49H6G9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
