window.products.push({"id":474550,"name":"Amlong Crystal Meditation Divnation Sphere Feng Shui Crystal Ball, Lensball, Decorative Ball with Wooden Stand and Gift Box, Blue, 2 inch (50mm) Diame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qlKyTHafL._AC_.jpg","description":"ur flawless crystal ball is handmade, polished, and inspected to ensure the highest K9 quality and consistency. Each crystal sphere is examined for clarity, and impurities before being packaged. It is made from 100% reconstituted quartz crystal. This process includes melting the quartz down and reforming at high temperature to ensure the highest clarity possible. A crystal ball has many uses, among the most common are photography, healing, meditation, Feng Shui, and home décor. Works great for photography lens ball. It can easily be held in one hand and used whether you are a professional photographer with a DSLR camera or an amateur with a cellphone camera. Easily create stunning effects utilizing crystal ball photography. No special effects or advanced knowledge needed. With some experimenting and practice you will have amazing results using this photography crystal ball. The crystal sphere ball for photography will fit into your camera bag for easy travel. When you think of a crystal ball, you usually will think of an image of a fortune teller, waving their hands around a crystal ball to conjure images inside the ball but a gazing ball is merely a tool for focusing your mind and freeing your third eye. The images you see will be in your mind’s eye, not in the ball itself. Use it for divinations and meditation purposes. Crystal gazing is your unconscious and conscious mind acting together. Let the images flow and change and take you wherever. The clarity of this sphere also makes it a great crystal decoration. It can add a sense of space or color to a mantle. Become the focus of a room as a striking centerpiece. It makes a great gift for family, friends, and co-workers. It is also a perfect décor for either home or office, even a surprising gift for some one. Paired with a mahogany colored wood stand that represents growth and creativity. Delivered securely packed in an authentic brand “Amlong Crystal” satin gift box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qlKyTHafL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amlong Crystal","source_asin":"B07VV6WB8J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474550","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VV6WB8J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VV6WB8J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":474551,"name":"EMCOLLECTION Home Bar Crystal Whiskey Gifts for Men, 5oz, Bourbon Glasses Old Fashioned | Cutter | Ideal for Cocktails, Scotch and Liquor's Lovers (Se","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cf3iu1E7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE PERFECT WHISKEY GLASS – Thick-based and heavy at the bottom, this sturdy whiskey glass has a weight to it and is a particularly excellent glass to swirl. It evokes the style of elegant barware and fits in the hand nicely due to the unique design that makes it easier to grip it. This glass is an excellent vessel for tasting spirits and appreciating the aroma and is large enough to add the rocks or build out Old Fashioned and other cocktails. And it is dishwasher-safe! THE ALL-TIMES CLASSIC – Whiskey, an old-fashioned gentlemen’s combo that never goes out of style. Now combined in the ultimate EMcollection bar set that includes one handsome whiskey glass, premium stainless steel cutters and a square marble tray. IDEAL ADDITION TO YOUR BAR – Indulge in a glass of good whiskey in the comfort of your home or office with the EMcollection set — and feel like a perfect gentleman. Or impress your guests by serving your top-shelf drinks in the elegant shot glass coupled with the fancy bar accessories. SHARP AND FANCY CUTTER – Made of premium stainless steel, our high-quality cutter is an essential accessory that makes it easier to cut up to 2 cm in diameter and save it for later. THE MARBLE TRAY - Made of natural dark gray marble stone, the square-shaped completes the ultimate gentlemen’s set. Solid, heavy and very stylish, it has room for 4 units. SUPERIOR PACKAGING - The decorative box is made of hard and heavy cardboard. The magnetic folding lid makes it easy to handle and protects the content. Inside of the box is layered with a sponge with sockets for every item proofing against breaking. Covered with black velvet to give the interior of the box that stylish and lush look. CHILLING STONES – You can increase the enjoyment and appreciation of your whiskey with purchasing our special set of granite Chilling Stones that will keep your drink cool without watering it down or weakening the flavor till the very last drop. Just 2 granite chilling stones is all that separates a good drink from a perfect one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cf3iu1E7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EMCOLLECTION","source_asin":"B0C4KQLHGF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4KQLHGF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4KQLHGF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
