window.products.push({"id":474571,"name":"ARAUJOBARGAIN Square LED Alarm Clock, Cubic Alarm Clock with Transformers Silhouette, Colorful Light-up Alarm Clock, Transformers Digital Alarm Clock,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xHQzixeGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of your basic alarm clock and want something new and trendy? Or are you looking for a unique gift for you or are you looking for something different? We have got a great solution for you-Our amazing Cubic Alarm Clock with a lot of features. Full of innovations Our Alarm clock is a creatively designed clock with a lot of new things, from a high-quality Transformers silhouette to Multiple LED lights, this alarm clock is full of surprises. It also has a plastic coating to make it water repellent and safe incredible lighting It emits seven different colors of soft light from inside, a soothing light with low intensity. A single tap on top of alarm clock makes the light turn on for 5 seconds to view time clearly during night time. A useful gift Our alarm clock is a very valuable and useful gift for kids, teenagers or even adults, Amazing present for birthdays, thanksgiving, Christmas, graduation gift or any other special days, A Transformers fan is going to love our incredible alarm clock. Optional OFF mode Do you also get irritated by the annoying alarm noise? Our alarm clock has a solution, it has a silent mode. It allows you to switch the alarm sound off and use this amazing device as a clock only. Battery Operated Our alarm clock is battery operated 4 AAA batteries (not included), 2 pcs AG13 Electronic that is included in this alarm clock. It has a stable structure and a standard size of 8*8*8 cm, it is extremely lightweight and easily portable. Décor your room with your favorite character, get this Transformers alarm clock today, click on “Buy Now”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xHQzixeGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARAUJOBARGAIN","source_asin":"B083H31YLR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083H31YLR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083H31YLR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
