window.products.push({"id":474644,"name":"World Tableware 139 004 Classic Rim Round Bowl Soup Spoon - Dozen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YY4DIiBEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Our non-slip base and ergonomic handle help sharpening process easier and safer than other models.This device sharpens your knives in a few seconds. Keep yourself and your family safe by using only sharp knives, not dull knives.Cutting with a dull knife makes you have to use extra force which is really dangerous. A slip of the knife can lead to serious accidents. Sharp knives are safer though this may seem counter-intuitive. How to use:1. Place the knife sharpener on a flat surface.2. Hold the knife sharpener by the stainless steel rod.3. For a dull knife, hold the knife by the handle and pull it along the coarse slot toward you many times depending on how dull the knife is.4. Move the knife to the fine slot and pull it toward you until it is as sharp as desired. It can take from 4 to 55 pulls depending on each knife. 5. Wipe the sharpener with a dry cloth to clean it up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YY4DIiBEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOVATIC","source_asin":"B00OMWNXQA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OMWNXQA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OMWNXQA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
