window.products.push({"id":474663,"name":"Handcrafted Diamond Hammered Traditional Indian 100% Pure Copper Bottle Leak Proof Ayurvedic 34 Oz Pitcher (Bubble)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UgftnTfkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Copper Bottle is a valuable addition to your daily accessories not only for its sleek and beautiful design but also for the health benefits of Ayurveda that it offers. Drink water out of the copper water bottle every morning after storing it overnight to hydrate your body. When water is stored in a copper vessel the copper gently leaches into the water and lends it all its positive properties. The bottle is eco-friendly as it is made of 100% pure copper. 8 to 10 glasses of water is the recommended intake each day but many of us fall short. So, if you fear that your water may be contaminated, store it in this Pure Copper Stylish Leak Proof Ayurvedic 34 Oz Water Bottle, drink it and rest assured you will be drinking healthy and clean water. Due to this being 100% pure copper, it is NOT dishwasher friendly. This copper bottle is rust-proof and has a wide mouth that makes it easy to clean. This bottle is not ideal for the storage and consumption of juices, milk, soda. It is also not microwave-safe or dishwasher-safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UgftnTfkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sania India Handcraft","source_asin":"B07RJQ5PW8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RJQ5PW8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RJQ5PW8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":474664,"name":"Labonida 4 Tier Shoe Storage Organizer Box, No-Assembly-Required Clear Shoe Boxes Container for Closet, Foldable Large Sneakers Display Case with Lids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7175CaXQUJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Extra Large Capacity】It's made of premium solid plastic and TPE, which combines the properties of plastic and rubber for superior performance. The overall size is 13.58\" L x 10\" W x 27.56\" H and a single box size is 13.58\" L x 10\" W x 7\"H . It is large enough to accommodate men's and women's US sizes up to 12, ideal for any place in the bedroom, living room, balcony, or cloakroom. 【Simple Sneaker Box, Defined By Yourself】A perfect gift for yourself or the sneakerhead friends on your list. As a sneaker lover, shoe boxes are essential for our lives. Unleash your creativity and design a unique shoe display wall of your own. 【Clear front opening And Stackable Design】 The embedded installation provides great stability for the combination stacking of shoe boxes, allowing you to stack them infinitely according to your preference and actual needs. Additionally, all four sides are transparent, allowing for a clear view of the shoes inside, making it the ideal carrier for shoe box display. 【Not Just A Shoe Storage Rack】 This excellent design can be matched with various styles and is available in two colors. It is widely used in cabinets, bedrooms, study rooms, dormitories, cloakrooms and collection rooms. And it can also be used as a storage box for clothing, toys, handicrafts, and souvenirs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7175CaXQUJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Labonida","source_asin":"B09G2BNTPD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474664","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G2BNTPD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G2BNTPD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":474665,"name":"Bellemain Stainless Steel 3 Cup Flour Sifter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JovPHqo-L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"STRONG AND LIGHTWEIGHT SIFTER HOLDS A FULL 3 CUPS: Home baking just got easier. This sifter holds more flour or powdered sugar than most sifters made for home use. Measurements are stamped right into the metal and can easily be read from inside the sifter as well as outside. CLASSIC RELIABLE HAND CRANK AND SINGLE MESH: Professionals prefer crank-style sifters over hand squeeze sifter models because they can stand up to repeated use without tiring out your hand. Sifting is effortless and clean up is super simple - no multi-layers of mesh for ingredients to get stuck. THE DOUBLE LOOP AGITATOR LEAVES NOTHING BEHIND: Lumps of flour and sugar can get left behind to clog the mesh screens when using squeeze handle models, but the Bellemain Flour Sifter cranks smoothly, capturing everything. Works great with fine and coarse flours like almond meal and oat bran. EASY FOR BAKERS WITH ARTHRITIS TO USE: Squeeze handles are hard to work and require hand strength - which means they can wear you out quickly. But the Bellemain Sifter’s hand crank operates smoothly and effortlessly - lightweight flours and sugars practically sift themselves. RUST RESISTANT STAINLESS STEEL WILL EASILY LAST A GENERATION OR MORE: Stainless steel is lightweight, but stronger than aluminum or plastic - so you never need to worry about cracks, chips, dents and scratches. This is the sifter that you'll still be using in 20 years","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JovPHqo-L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bellemain","source_asin":"B00XIIHKFO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XIIHKFO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XIIHKFO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
