window.products.push({"id":474698,"name":"Rock Your Chakra Nephrite Jade 2\" 4-7 Oz Raw Large Lapidary Rocks and Minerals Heart Chakra Healing Crystals","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KRwvY5vML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Very high quality olive green Nephrite Jade imported by Rock Your Chakra from British Columbia, Canada. These are light green on the outside but when cut open are a very rich high quality green jade inside. (See Photos) Perfect for lapidary cutting and polishing.You will receive one specimen from the lot shown in the photos 2 inch to 2 1/2 inch specimen and weighing between 4 to 7 ounces. Healing Properties Jade is most valued for its metaphysical properties and is a heart chakra stone. It is the ultimate \"Dream Stone,\" revered in ancient cultures, as well as today, to access the spiritual world, gain insight into ritualistic knowledge, encourage creativity, and dream-solve. It is cherished as a protective talisman, assuring long life and a peaceful death, and is considered a powerful healing stone. An amulet of good luck and friendship, Jade signifies wisdom gathered in tranquility, dispelling the negative and encouraging one to see oneself as they really are. Mineral Description Jade is said to bless whatever it touches, serving mankind across the globe for nearly 6,000 years. For primitive peoples in the British Isles, its toughness, and ability to polish and sharpen made it a favored stone for axe heads, knives and weapons. Jade has been the most highly esteemed stone in China throughout recorded history, and was valued for its beauty and powers of healing and protection. Nephrite Jade is a calcium magnesium silicate and exceptionally tough stone, in the beautiful olive shades we've come to recognize as jade green. It has a smooth surface polish with a waxy sheen and is commonly found.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KRwvY5vML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rock Your Chakra","source_asin":"B07ZGLDLCB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZGLDLCB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZGLDLCB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
