window.products.push({"id":474840,"name":"Fabric Frame Cover Photo Album 200 Pockets Hold 4x6 Photos, Deep Black (2 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816qksOTDmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Pioneer DA-200CBF Bi-Directional Cloth Frame Album features a deep black cloth cover and is designed to display and protect 200 4 x 6\" photos. There is a 3.5 x 3.5\" cover window for a theme image. The image is inserted from a pocket inside the album's front cover. The 2-up style pages can display two horizontal or one vertical image per side.The clear, side-loading pages protect your photos from dust and fingerprints. The shaded background on each page enhances the presentation of your photographs. There is a memo area next to each photo. The book-bound binding enables the open pages to lay flat for quick loading and optimal viewing. A dust jacket is included in which you can store the album. The album is acid-free for long-term archival photo-storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816qksOTDmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pioneer Photo Albums","source_asin":"B07JRGRXQF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JRGRXQF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JRGRXQF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
