window.products.push({"id":474956,"name":"Reusable Grocery Bag with Long Handle, Large Thermal Insulated Cooler Bag Keep Food Cold/Warm for Kitchen, Delivery, Shopping & Picnic, 30L Heavy Duty","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+gQ-IMB+L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"🥪【HEAVY-DUTY & DURABLE】: Our insulated bags are made of premium Oxford cloth which is more durable and tear-resistant than non-woven fabric shopping bags, which can hold up to 50lb. 🥪【EXCELLENT INSULATION & EASY to CLEAN】: Aluminum-covered thermal insulation keeps food’s temperature for 5hours. No hassles of cleaning these insulated bags, because the inner lining is designed as grease-repellent. 🥪【LARGE CAPACITY & FOLDABLE】: Size: 16.54x10.6x10.2\"(LxWxH) This reusable tote bag can be folded flat and stored in your pantry or kitchen overhead cabinets when not in use. 🥪【LIGHT-WEIGHT & BACK-SIDE POCKET】: We made this reusable shopping bag light-weight (0.3kg) to reach your maximum comfort when you haul. There is a back-side pocket to restore your belongings like phone, keys, etc. 🥪【Convenience & Multi- Occasion】：Strawing string feature enables you to place and pack food easier. There are many styles and you can pick one to accommodate your daily outfit. The thermal bag is great for grocery shopping, farmers markets, picnics, beach, camping, boating，trips，BBQ and all food transport.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+gQ-IMB+L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iknoe","source_asin":"B08N6KNXLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N6KNXLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N6KNXLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":474957,"name":"Composition 1921 Artwork by Lyubov Popova, 18 by 24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819TBK0FEuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This gallery-wrapped art piece features colorful, abstract, geometric shapes. Lyubov Popova (24 April 1889 - 25 May 1924) was a Russian avant-garde painter and designer. Through a synthesis of styles she worked towards what she termed painterly architectonics. After first exploring Impressionism, by 1913 she was experimenting with the particularly Russian development of Cubo-Futurism: a fusion of two equal influences from France and Italy. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819TBK0FEuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00G6DNLHO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-474957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G6DNLHO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G6DNLHO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
